<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-ATP WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ATP WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of round-robin group matches on the third day of the ATP Tour world championship on Thursday (prefix number denotes world ranking):</p>
<p>White Group</p>
<p>2-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat 4-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) 6-7 (8-10) 7-6 (7-5) 6-1</p>
<p>Red group</p>
<p>6-Boris Becker (Germany) beat 1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) 7-6 (12-10) 7-6 (7-4)  </p>
<p>Red group</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat 9-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden)</p>
<p>6-3 7-6 (7-5).</p>
</text>
